## Notes
- create/prompt/cancel/rename/list -> sessionController (structural ctx.sessionController; no dsh-api-session-controller import).
- workspace create/rename/delete -> workspaceController; listWorkspaces -> workspaceRegistry.list() + archivedSessionIds.
- wait running -> controller.list; turn/end -> sessions.get(id).snapshotEvents() or sessionPersistence.inspect.
- Remote slash codes mapped to hyphen: session/not-found, session/title-invalid->title-invalid, workspace/not-found, workspace/name-conflict, workspace/invalid-path.
- subagent.prompt: uses injected ctx.subagents (SubagentRuntime) continuable prompt when present; if not injected, fails loud (no HTTP loopback). Task 8 can inject ctx.subagents from the web-app tree.
- Classes are re-exported from session-tool-local index; SessionToolLocalService still constructs HTTP clients so CLI cannot write its own store (Task 8 selector).
